        "TileImage": "$($repository 9b0d0651-4f81-40e5-bf2a-5aec6fd763a5).Image",
        "Description": "47,today&apos;s turget is Ted Mendez and Robert Knox.Ted Mendes is a US Army procurer who is trying to procure state-of-the-art robotic weapons from Robert Knox.And he is the undisputed robotics engineer and CEO of Kronstadt industries.The cliant is a competitor of Clonstadt T\\Industries and is trying to give an advantage in the bidding competition by showing the defects of it.Therefore I ask you to assassinate Robert Knox in a way that ruin&apos;s Clonstadt&apos;s credibility as much as  possible.",
